abstract: "Code, benchmark and result files for Regulated Generative Analytics, a four-stage pipeline in which a language model proposes a structured specification, a semantic check validates it against predefined metric definitions, deterministic code computes the result, and a credibility-based validation stage assigns an evidence status recorded in a warrant."
